  "_pricing_provenance": "Anthropic pricing page (platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing), read 2026-10-05; standard global Claude API $/MTok (t/3941#4). Cache reads are 0.1x input EXCEPT claude-fable-5-1 (0.025x = 0.25) and claude-opus-5-5 (0.05x = 0.20); claude-fable-5 cache read is 1.00. Sonnet 5 is 2/10 standard — the scheduled 2026-09-01 rise to 3/15 was CANCELLED (pricing-page footnote); the prior stored 3/15 was Sonnet 4.6's price. Schema has no cache-write field; 5m/1h cache-write prices are intentionally not stored (adding one is a schema change). t/3946 BACKFILL (2026-10-05, PR #2840): priced all reachable models, re-keyed orphans, and filled cache rates from live provider pages. PROMO (ends 2026-12-31): gemini-3.8-flash and gemini-3.6-flash are at promotional 0.75/3.75/0.075 (in/out/cache) that DOUBLES on 2027-01-01 to 1.50/7.50/0.15 per ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/pricing; refresh tracked in t/3974 (due 2026-12-31). CONTEXT TIER: openai-gpt-5.5 (5/30/0.50) and openai-gpt-5.5-pro (30/180; cachedInputPer1M=input, as no cache price is published) are stored at the <272K-token SHORT-context rate — long context (>272K) is roughly 2x and is NOT modelled (schema has no per-context-tier field). TIER DETAIL (Shared Lib p/726#29): gemini-3.1-pro-preview (2/12/0.20) is stored at the <=200k-token tier, so long context is under-costed; deepseek-v4-flash and deepseek-v4-pro are stored at the standard/PEAK rate — the off-peak 50% discount (UTC window, weekends/holidays) is not modelled. HAIKU 5.5 (t/4086, Anthropic pricing page read 2026-10-07): claude-haiku-5-5 is priced BY PROMPT LENGTH; the stored value is the base <=100K-token tier (input 0.10, output 0.50, cache-read 0.01). The >100K-token tier is 5x (input 0.50, output 2.50, cache-read 0.05) and is NOT modelled (schema has no per-context-tier field). Cache read is the standard 0.1x of base input. Haiku 5.5 has a 1M context window (Models API max_input_tokens=1000000) but, like every other Claude model here, inherits the claude backend capabilityDefault (200000) with no per-model override — a pre-existing Claude context-modeling gap, not changed in this ticket.",
